Implements the data layer for the Dynamic Forms module — TypeScript models with TitleCase properties and a `FormsService` backed by the generic `ApiService`. No components or UI logic included.

## Models (`src/app/core/models/dynamic-form.model.ts`)

TitleCase-property interfaces mirroring the backend contract:

```typescript
export interface DynamicFormField {
  Id: string;
  Name: string;
  Label: string;
  Type: DynamicFieldType;
  Required: boolean;
  Order: number;
  Placeholder?: string;
  Options?: DynamicFormFieldOption[];
  MinLength?: number;
  MaxLength?: number;
  DefaultValue?: string;
}

export interface DynamicForm {
  Id: string;
  Title: string;
  Fields: DynamicFormField[];
  Status: FormStatus;
  CreatedAt: Date;
  UpdatedAt: Date;
  Description?: string;
}

export interface DynamicFormSubmission {
  FormId: string;
  Data: Record<string, unknown>;
  SubmittedAt?: Date;
}
```

Supporting types: `DynamicFieldType`, `FormStatus`, `SubmissionStatus`, `DynamicFormFieldOption`, `DynamicFormSubmissionResponse`.

## Service (`src/app/core/services/forms.service.ts`)

Signal-based state with three `ApiService`-backed async methods:

```typescript
export class FormsService {
  readonly Forms = this._forms.asReadonly();       // signal<DynamicForm[]>
  readonly IsLoading = this._isLoading.asReadonly();
  readonly Error = this._error.asReadonly();

  fetchForms(): Promise<DynamicForm[]>                              // GET /forms
  fetchFormById(id: string): Promise<DynamicForm | null>            // GET /forms/:id
  submitForm(s: DynamicFormSubmission): Promise<DynamicFormSubmissionResponse | null> // POST /forms/:id/submit
}
```

## Exports

- `dynamic-form.model` added to `src/app/core/models/index.ts`
- `forms.service` added to `src/app/core/services/index.ts`

